 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-mapper-m4",
  "date": "2026-11-17",
  "draft_py": "# FDN Tragic Banshee: \"Morbid — When this creature enters, target creature an opponent controls\n# gets -1/-1 until end of turn. If a creature died this turn, that creature gets -13/-13 until end\n# of turn instead.\"  M21 Life Goes On's \"instead\" (verified): Conditional(DIED_THIS_TURN, then the\n# replacing effect, else the first), read as the ability resolves; one TARGET slot read by both\n# branches (\"that creature\"). Morbid is an ability word (no condition of its own here: the \"if\"\n# is not an intervening one).\nFOE = Selector(\n    count=QConst(value=1),\n    mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n    filter=FAnd(\n        children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.OPPONENT),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n        ),\n    ),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\nwail = TriggeredAbility(\n    event=ZoneChangeEvent(\n        from_zone=Zone(kind=ZoneKind.ANY, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),\n        to_zone=Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),\n        subject=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n    ),\n    condition=None,\n    effect=Conditional(\n        pred=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.DIED_THIS_TURN),\n        then_effect=A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n            'duration': DurationEot(),\n            'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.DECREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=13)),\n            'target': FOE,\n            'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.DECREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=13)),\n        }),\n        else_effect=A(Verb.MODIFY_PT, {\n            'duration': DurationEot(),\n            'power': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.DECREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=1)),\n            'target': FOE,\n            'toughness': PtDelta(direction=PtDirection.DECREASE, magnitude=QConst(value=1)),\n        }),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [wail, *compiled]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Morbid — When this creature enters, target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.",
    "ir": "abilities[0].event, abilities[0].effect.else_effect"
   },
   {
    "clause": "If a creature died this turn, that creature gets -13/-13 until end of turn instead.",
    "ir": "abilities[0].effect.pred, abilities[0].effect.then_effect"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "Life Goes On's 'instead' (verified): Conditional(DIED_THIS_TURN, -13/-13, else -1/-1), read as the ability resolves, one TARGET slot read by both branches. Morbid is an ability word. Packs: tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/tragic_banshee_morbid_minus_thirteen.json, tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/tragic_banshee_morbid_ends_with_the_turn.json."
